{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0593_1000_p", "source_sha256": "892795812f360a2518aec8e22572c6a975e085b1019b4c4c355fad3317539b07", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌のタイアップ企画の撮影で、歩と雪山に\n来ている。ここで待機するように言われたが……）", "zh": "（为了写真杂志联动企划的拍摄，和步一起来到了雪山。\n虽然被告知要在这里待命……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0593_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a7db51f98877150775d547d0de8a3a53d34b222f945a2fd0f43bff70f4eacfa9", "ja": "なかなか声がかからないな……。\nううっ、まずい、少し眠くなってきた……。", "zh": "一直没人来叫我们啊……\n呜，好糟糕，有点困起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0593_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "050eec99f8cab1f5289afff85bc8201868e48f3efcf44d29cde5c09d38ef57da", "ja": "あーっ！　{$P$}！！\nやっと見つけた！", "zh": "啊——！{$P$}！！\n终于找到你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0593_1003_p", "source_sha256": "15b5e958984bfffe0ca6d363d5e94d1542b9e7b6bfcb771bfeb238ed1e7c1eef", "ja": "ハッ！　君は……イエティ……？\nまさか、そんな……イエティは本当にいたのか……？", "zh": "哈！你是……雪怪……？\n难道说……雪怪真的存在吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0593_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b4285a4f83e9274ab9b431e3869f6b0ff391d4a80a0f2d5fa2bb9467e709ed04", "ja": "そんなわけないでしょ！？　{$P$}、\nアタシだよ、アタシ！　舞浜歩！！", "zh": "怎么可能嘛！？　{$P$}，\n是我啊，是我！　舞滨步！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0593_1005_p", "source_sha256": "00dca9aa827a702e63d39208ab8c3293721786b39e3cb36ccbe94e004eb97f4f", "ja": "えっ？　……ああ、歩か。\nごめん、ちょっと意識が遠くにいってたみたいで……。", "zh": "咦？……啊，是步啊。\n抱歉，我刚才好像有点走神了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0593_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d3c702c3b780de549a37f871bc976dff096db09c40eedd9dfa3c4f4d47fac47b", "ja": "それどころじゃないよ～！　{$P$}、\nみんなに置いてかれるとこだったんだよ～！？", "zh": "才不是那个时候啦～！{$P$}，刚才差点就被大家甩在后面了啦～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0593_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4cf9d25fbafd681e6a54a74168ac940d93f3695d5133f88e718971e8b323c636", "ja": "…………えっ？", "zh": "…………啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0593_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2c7437cc7c323a323c2806760fe95a50575e003caaba142f14ee4fff3e03bb92", "ja": "{$P$}が、バスに乗ってないって\n気づいて、慌てて戻ってきたんだから！", "zh": "发现{$P$}没上公交车，慌慌张张地赶回来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0593_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c455acc3dcf2941be5b48ae5f3298c3a28b24112d56fe0eeea262037bb5862d6", "ja": "電話も出ないし、メッセージも既読にならないし……。\n{$P$}に、何かあったら……ぐすっ。", "zh": "电话也不接，消息也没显示已读……要是{$P$}出了什么事……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0593_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4853a94ce75cb4bcfba86d8e58d6345176a0cef5c8491a04b3b188c4d8e22795", "ja": "そ、そうだな。ごめん。迷惑かけてしまったな……。\n早くロケバスに戻ろ……はっくしゅん！！", "zh": "好、好吧。对不起，给你添麻烦了……  \n赶紧回外景车吧……阿嚏！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0593_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "401a076c2d35b676b541e77cf9d5f367a3597c5526c7e6c406dbf744db7ba5ed", "ja": "うう……やっぱり体冷えちゃったよね？　アタシが本物\nのイエティだったら、あっためてあげられたのに……。", "zh": "呜呜……果然身体冻僵了吧？要是我真的是\n雪人的话，就能帮你暖和过来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0593_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1f9f5f87b33746daf3dce34020e19423d25bde30c44880c4ff8ee18a3269243d", "ja": "確かに……。本物のイエティに抱きしめられたら、\nすごく暖かそうだもんな。", "zh": "说得也是……要是被真正的雪人抱住的话，感觉会非常暖和呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0593_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "666af8fa844a6919a88b7ddf9d1f53d731b67f93e8df67c2db22c7684818a59b", "ja": "そうそう。モフモフの毛皮で{$P$}を\nギュギュっと抱きしめて……ん？　アタシがギュっと？", "zh": "没错没错。用毛茸茸的皮毛把{$P$}\n紧紧抱住……嗯？是我把它紧紧抱住？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0593_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2438b313cef7f44261bfacc3c127ac6b180a05819cf10953f2cd45703ccae772", "ja": "歩？", "zh": "步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0593_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4696102dd618c323386ac6bb20d6c19c0dd0937d563aa83a2534f0100e356522", "ja": "うえっ！？　い、いやいやいや……なんでもないっ！\nと、とにかく、早く移動しよう！", "zh": "呜哇！？没、没有没有没有……什么事都没有！\n总、总之，快点走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0593_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e49fafe3b94ecede16698d72478a25b51ff8d1cc86d9e1eaa1d0c168c6f03ff3", "ja": "ほら、{$P$}！\nロケバスはあっち……は、はっくしゅん！", "zh": "看，{$P$}！外景车在那边……哈、哈啾！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0593_1017_p", "source_sha256": "56a9298389ce301cf904f8e10ffa38923d4154538a5189a55eaf1e22df4ef588", "ja": "あ、待ってくれ歩！\n……は、はっくしゅん！！！", "zh": "啊，等等，步！\n……哈、哈啾！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
